              "name": "report",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=#### Incident Summary\n{{ $('Reporter').item.json.output.summary }}\n\n#### Root Cause\n{{ $('Reporter').item.json.output.root_cause }}\n\n#### Actions\n{{ $('Reporter').item.json.output.actions?.length \n  ? `$${$json.output.actions.map(item => `- $${item}`).join(\"\\n\")}` \n  : \"- No actions identified.\" \n}}\n\n#### Evidence\n**Trace**  \n{{ $('Tempo Report').item.json.tempo.trace\n? `\\`\\`\\`\n$${$('Tempo Report').item.json.tempo.trace}\n\\`\\`\\``\n: \"No traces found.\"\n}}\n\n**Logs**\n{{ $('Loki Report').item.json.loki.logs?.length\n? `\\`\\`\\`\n$${$('Loki Report').item.json.loki.logs.map(item => `$${item}`).join(\"\\n\")}\n\\`\\`\\``\n: \"No logs found.\"\n}}"
